{% extends "blogs/base.twig" %}

{% set pageTitle = "Programming Experience" %}
{% set blogTitle = "Programming Experience" %}
{% set blogSubtitle = "💻 How I Built My Skills" %}

{% block blog_content %}
    <section class="mt-4 container">
        <h3> Building Skills Through Real-World Experience </h3>
        <p>
            My programming journey has taken me through internships, education, and personal projects.
            Each experience taught me something different whether it was working with hardware-integrated software,
            building cross-platform apps, or developing game systems. These opportunities shaped how I approach
            problem-solving and software development today.
        </p>

        <h4 class="mt-4"> Key Experiences </h4>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Internship at Epesi:</strong> Worked with FlutterFlow and Dart to build mobile a mobile app to track football game events, learning rapid prototyping and cross-platform development.</li>
            <li><strong>Internship at Moduvision:</strong> Developed software in C# that interacted with autosamplers, gaining hands-on experience with hardware integration and technical debugging.</li>
            <li><strong>MBO Education in Software Development:</strong> Built foundational projects like Pasimo, QR-Goats, and Slidehub using frameworks like Struts 2, Hibernate, and Bootstrap, working in team environments with Scrum methodology.</li>
            <li><strong>Game Development with Roblox Studio:</strong> Created multiple games and systems using Luau, including admin panels, exploration games, and competitive multiplayer minigames, learning event-driven programming and DataStores.</li>
        </ul>

        <h4 class="mt-4"> Languages & Technologies </h4>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Languages:</strong> Luau, C#, JavaScript, Java, Dart partially, SQL, HTML/CSS, PHP.</li>
            <li><strong>Frameworks & Tools:</strong> FlutterFlow, Struts 2, Hibernate, Bootstrap.</li>
            <li><strong>Development Tools:</strong> Roblox Studio, Eclipse IDE, VSCode, MySQL Workbench, InteliJ</li>
            <li><strong>Methodologies:</strong> Scrum, version control, debugging, and testing in both solo and team environments</li>
        </ul>

        <p class="mt-4">
            From working on cross-platform mobile apps to building hardware-integrated software and creating multiplayer games,
            these experiences gave me a diverse skill set. I learned to adapt to different languages and environments,
            collaborate with teams, and solve complex technical challenges. This foundation continues to drive my growth as a developer.
        </p>
    </section>
{% endblock %}